azy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Druid_Male_Addon_3_c1f75a.gif\" width=\"46\"/></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Female\n</th>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Druid Female\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"46\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Druid_Female_581e8b.gif\" width=\"46\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Druid Female Addon 1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"46\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Druid_Female_Addon_1_836420.gif\" width=\"46\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Druid Female Addon 2\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"46\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Druid_Female_Addon_2_2cd226.gif\" width=\"46\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Druid Female Addon 3\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"46\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Druid_Female_Addon_3_0f5562.gif\" width=\"46\"/></span>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-outfit-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Nature-loving and peaceful druids might like this outfit, especially the beast-like addons. I heard that there is a druid living near Ab'Dendriel, who might be able to provide fitting addons.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Outfits\">Related Outfits</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body\">\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Premium_Outfits\">Premium Outfits</span></h4>\n<div class=\"navigation-list-wrapper\"><ul><li>Barbarian Outfits</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Nobleman%20Outfits\">Nobleman Outfits</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Oriental%20Outfits\">Oriental Outfits</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Summoner%20Outfits\">Summoner Outfits</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wi